{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/extras/3da184acd0d60e13437c28a41f2c4439.avif?t=1769204759\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/extras_big/3da184acd0d60e13437c28a41f2c4439.avif?t=1769204759 width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the chosen one, the heir to the Emperor's legacy. On the desolate planet of Sphera, a war for power has ravaged the continent of Centradia for decades. As the wielder of imperial power, you've joined the BLAZE HOUND, a peacekeeping force intervening in battles across the globe through Liberators, mercenary soldiers with unwavering determination.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/extras/11b2e5df98a4829c4226f3a8055000c2.avif?t=1769204759\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/extras_big/11b2e5df98a4829c4226f3a8055000c2.avif?t=1769204759 width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command your Battlercore and Liberators in top-down battles.</strong> Strategically deploy your forces, unleash devastating attacks, and coordinate with your teammates to overcome overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/extras/14fb5fb29feeedf2cc5f0876701ac077.avif?t=1769204759\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/extras_big/14fb5fb29feeedf2cc5f0876701ac077.avif?t=1769204759 width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your missions and shape the fate of the war.</strong> Navigate a dynamic world map, respond to evolving events, and make critical decisions that will impact the outcome of the conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain unit proficiency to unlock advanced tiers of Battlercores and Liberators.</strong> As you and your forces grow stronger, you'll gain access to more powerful equipment and abilities, giving you a tactical edge in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/extras/2469cb62a6c681d88c5269ea0725ffae.avif?t=1769204759\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/extras_big/2469cb62a6c681d88c5269ea0725ffae.avif?t=1769204759 width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your time at the NEST, the advanced spacecraft Prominus-1.</strong> Interact with your crewmates, forge bonds, and develop their skills to ensure their loyalty and effectiveness in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to sacrifice it all for a chance at a brighter future?</strong> Lead your forces into brutal, mechanized warfare against massive Battlercore robots and restore peace to the war-torn planet of Sphera.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3286730?t=1769204759","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3286730?t=1769204759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/ffefbf83826257dce303cdfeea1b0c63981c2ae7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769204759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286730/ffefbf83826257dce303cdfeea1b0c63981c2ae7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769204759","categories":[{"descrip